{"time": 1770201668, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1697528496", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1044159263", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "不小心摔倒了“哎呦，好痛”"}
{"time": 1770201737, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2123367926", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1044159263", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "全班一时间安静了下来，你们刚刚发出动静，班长折原临也走到门边扶起了横须贺，\"别乱叫。\"他回头看向神山露，“我们送他去保健室吧”"}
{"time": 1770201764, "type": "recv", "message_id": "321060599", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1044159263", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "而星野鸫完全不在意一般，拍拍身上的灰，径直离开了"}
{"time": 1770201806, "type": "recv", "message_id": "852002197", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1044159263", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯...”爬起身，拍拍身上的灰"}
