{"time": 1770730282, "type": "recv", "message_id": "239951150", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1044159263", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（这边）"}
{"time": 1770730350, "type": "recv", "message_id": "202533075", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1044159263", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“神山同学怎么今天有兴趣来这边？还是说是来找我的？”"}
{"time": 1770730470, "type": "recv", "message_id": "869683874", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1044159263", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（原来是）"}
{"time": 1770730510, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1815171514", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1044159263", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“呵呵，雨纪酱还真是健忘啊”提下手上的剑“剑道社在弓道社旁边啦，对了，这位是？”"}
{"time": 1770730514, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1660392303", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1044159263", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“诶诶？”旁边的短发女生看了看神山，“前辈，她是？”"}
{"time": 1770730526, "type": "recv", "message_id": "142854046", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1044159263", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=869683874]（原来？）"}
{"time": 1770730603, "type": "recv", "message_id": "956904253", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1044159263", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1660392303]“这是我同班的朋友，神山露。”换一边介绍“这是弓道部的学妹，天宫秋”"}
{"time": 1770730693, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1124812280", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1044159263", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“你好啊天宫学妹”"}
{"time": 1770730827, "type": "recv", "message_id": "876811913", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1044159263", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“嗨！神山学姐下午好。”她的笑容称得上甜美，对着你甜甜一笑，“有什么事吗？”"}
{"time": 1770730906, "type": "recv", "message_id": "648773518", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1044159263", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“没什么事啦，正巧碰到，那再见了，我也去社团活动了，拜拜”"}
{"time": 1770730926, "type": "recv", "message_id": "678547860", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1044159263", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（正巧在哪）"}
{"time": 1770730943, "type": "recv", "message_id": "622967919", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1044159263", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（你还专门走进来）"}
{"time": 1770730950, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1248287154", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1044159263", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（就为了打个招呼？）"}
{"time": 1770731001, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2035656481", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1044159263", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“诶？正巧吗？”秋的视线扫过你们，“我说，你们不会待会要一起偷偷去什么地方玩不带我吧？”"}
{"time": 1770731031, "type": "recv", "message_id": "926664251", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1044159263", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1248287154]（是啊）"}
{"time": 1770731034, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1402319857", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1044159263", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（要不呢）"}
{"time": 1770731048, "type": "recv", "message_id": "891374273", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1044159263", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（我们设定不是好朋友吗）"}
{"time": 1770731096, "type": "recv", "message_id": "368513577", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1044159263", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“还有这种事吗”挠头“可是要到社团活动时间了哎”"}
{"time": 1770731099, "type": "recv", "message_id": "941513308", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1044159263", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我是打算去后山摇个签。”*放下弓，准备把衣服换回来“祈个福什么的”"}
{"time": 1770731149, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1309242793", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1044159263", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“怎么还信这种东西啦。”秋摇摇头，短发随着动作扬起，“那我也要去。”"}
{"time": 1770731186, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1648837415", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1044159263", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那我和你们一起吧..听起来很有意思的样子”"}
{"time": 1770731201, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1590264642", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1044159263", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“信神总比信鬼好些吧”"}
{"time": 1770731244, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1519308976", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1044159263", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“那个神社都没什么人去，真的是神吗？”秋吐槽道"}
{"time": 1770731391, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1625945459", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1044159263", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“收着香火的话，鬼也得推磨的吧”开个玩笑，这就准备出发了"}
{"time": 1770731462, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2134869129", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1044159263", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "跟在后面"}
{"time": 1770731484, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1891469720", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1044159263", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“话说雨纪，你告诉社团指导老师了吗”"}
{"time": 1770731595, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1136991514", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1044159263", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“什么？”"}
{"time": 1770731709, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1533129228", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1044159263", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“准备去后山...毕竟不是还有社团活动吗”"}
{"time": 1770731740, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1065818116", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1044159263", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“练习而已，又不是集训”"}
{"time": 1770731773, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1865567498", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1044159263", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“也对，那走吧”"}
{"time": 1770732026, "type": "recv", "message_id": "977907192", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1044159263", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(补一下秋的立绘，认真思考之后)"}
{"time": 1770732029, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1126887588", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1044159263", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file=030CE8F6DFA8FFF1C7C4648DA58C4CE8.jpg,sub_type=0,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhRWJl-ZuCOY1T4XYS5T9FLbX72SDRiooBUg_woo0dit7IrPkgMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQOZEIgkuDSZvgJgX3kmwVfHoCEDCCAQJuag&amp;rkey=CAMSMObWPSjn82cap0a2L_r36sQ8jwF5StThzfJYGnibwnHMs__YE0juXo8VlPgSskGsFQ,file_size=348200]"}
{"time": 1770732032, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1227741207", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1044159263", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(不如长这样吧)"}
{"time": 1770732037, "type": "recv", "message_id": "557082173", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1044159263", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（呃呃）"}
{"time": 1770732044, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1819189723", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1044159263", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "*总之上山"}
{"time": 1770732093, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2019302832", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1044159263", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "*总之上山"}
{"time": 1770732749, "type": "recv", "message_id": "522432955", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1044159263", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "离开学校，通往后山的道路姑且像是有人收拾的样子，虽然杂草和藤蔓丛生，但至少杂草没有长到阻碍通行的地步。不过树林茂盛，在这下午时分，竟有些阴冷感"}
{"time": 1770732881, "type": "recv", "message_id": "682554564", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1044159263", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“不会有蛇吧.. ”看到这种场景，不免有些担忧"}
{"time": 1770732923, "type": "recv", "message_id": "593061231", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1044159263", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"是哦?\"秋也皱着眉头，\"这破地方多久没人来过了。\""}
{"time": 1770732944, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1831148093", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1044159263", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"也不知道那神社怎么开下去，还有没有巫女啦。\""}
{"time": 1770732976, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1506600910", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1044159263", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“不知道，我也是第一次来”"}
{"time": 1770733085, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1540867466", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1044159263", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“雨纪怎么忽然想去了”"}
{"time": 1770733141, "type": "recv", "message_id": "42781371", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1044159263", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"刚刚前辈突然问我那个神社的事，然后就想去祈福诶，今天射箭也射不准。\"你们看见秋浑身抖了抖，\"前辈不会被脏东西附身了吧？\""}
{"time": 1770733155, "type": "recv", "message_id": "147550195", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1044159263", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“明知故问呢……”摇摇头“就当是有话想和神明说吧”"}
{"time": 1770733249, "type": "recv", "message_id": "36049162", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1044159263", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“？”有些摸不着头脑"}
{"time": 1770733416, "type": "recv", "message_id": "129383187", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1044159263", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“提心吊胆的日子还是短一些的好”体能还算凑合，路上不打算歇脚，一边看着没什么吸引力的风景一边上山"}
{"time": 1770733452, "type": "recv", "message_id": "956249258", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1044159263", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "叹口气，跟在身后“遇到危险的话，我会保护你们的”紧盯路过的草丛"}
